feat(antispam): add passive anti-spam protection to all forms

- Add honeypot fields (hidden inputs that bots fill)
- Add time-based validation (reject submissions < 3 seconds)
- Add content pattern filtering (excessive URLs, spam keywords)
- Add disposable email blocking
- Add name validation

Removed Cloudflare Turnstile per user request - keeping only
passive protections that don't require external services.
